,["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the St. Mary Parish record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the parish grids January to February and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025 the late pairs ran short on the middle, with August to September at 56%, September to October at 51% and October to November at 50% of normal. Grid 11255 had its driest year in 2023 at 64%, and the other grids hit bottom in 2011.</p>"}
